{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51781","headline":"过三岭苎溪 · 清豁","name":"过三岭苎溪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"世人休说行路难，鸟道羊肠咫尺间。\n珍重苎溪溪[畔]（上）水，汝归[沧]（苍）海我归山。\n（《古今图书集成·职方典》一○五二《泉州府部》〖2〗）（〖1〗《全唐诗》卷八八八收清豁诗一首，无传，兹据《景德传灯录》卷二二、《宋诗纪事》卷九一补其事迹：清豁，福州永泰人，俗姓张。\n嗣睡龙道溥禅师，住漳州保福院。\n刺史陈洪进表奏，赐号性空禅师。\n太平兴国年卒。\n原收入时）（代未详僧，今移此。\n〖2〗《景德传灯录》卷二二以此诗爲清豁「遗偈」，今据以校改。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"清豁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51781.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51781","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}